# Project Hermes Router Template

Use this project context only as a router. Keep project-specific instructions thin.

## Knowledge

For repository questions, start with `wiki/index.md`, then read the routed wiki page and the cited source file before answering. Treat the wiki as synthesized guidance; source code and operational documents remain authoritative.

## Operating rules

- Read relevant project instructions and source before changing files.
- Use the repository's documented verification command before reporting completion.
- Update the wiki only through the installed `llm-wiki-setup` and `wiki-update` skills; claim writes must use the deterministic `wiki-update` gate resolver.
